sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App
  participant Retriever
  participant Tool
  participant Model
  participant Langfuse

  User->>App: Ask a product question
  App->>Langfuse: Start trace with user/session metadata
  App->>Langfuse: Add prompt assembly span
  App->>Retriever: Search trusted content
  Retriever-->>App: Candidate passages
  App->>Langfuse: Add retrieval span with source ids
  App->>Tool: Optional deterministic action
  Tool-->>App: Tool result or error
  App->>Langfuse: Add tool observation
  App->>Model: Generate grounded answer
  Model-->>App: Answer, token usage, latency
  App->>Langfuse: Add generation observation
  App-->>User: Answer with citations or fallback
  App->>Langfuse: End trace with output and status
